@segment 26-28 Wetlands II
@start-level 26
# Human, any class (made from the Gnome route by tools/derive_anyclass.py). From the dwarf route's segment 09: same quests, order, binds and flights, minus the
# class quests. Removed: the Call of Water steps 94500 (hand-in), 94501 and 94502, with the side trips to the
# waterfalls in the south-east Wetlands and to the house in the north of Loch Modan made only for them; all
# class-ability hints (now class-neutral). The end of the segment is unchanged in kind: from the Angerfang
# Encampment you walk the Dun Algaz road to Thelsamar and fly to Ironforge, now without the two detours.
# No travel had to be replaced. No training stop in this segment.
# Added 2026-11-11 from the Questie audit (tools/questie_near.py): 98209 Bloom of the Heavens (1200 XP) is taken; it is handed in on the next Auberdine landing.
